      "entry": "Bitcoin Forecasting \u2014 LSTM time-series service",
      "text": "Trained a forecasting LSTM with cyclic date encoding and TimeSeriesSplit grid-search tuning, then deployed it behind a TensorFlow Serving REST API."
    }
